ble/releases/2026/07/STScI-01KY7FCQSFZQV2HS57RRQSQF9N.jpg?w=1280&#038;h=720&#038;fit=clip&#038;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"On a black background, a pixelated, partial ring of bright pink and purple extends from 8 ou2019clock clockwise to 3 ou2019clock. There is a black gap at the bottom of the ring as well as in the middle. Below the ring, a timeline labeled millions of years ago lists the numbers 500, 200, 100, 50, 25, 0. The numbers 500 and 200 are yellow with a yellow line between them, indicating that the image shows the rate of star formation that was occurring in that timeframe.\" style=\"transform: scale(1.2); transform-origin: 50% 50%; object-position: 50% 50%; object-fit: cover;\" block_context=\"nasa-block\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://assets.science.nasa.gov/dynamicimage/assets/science/missions/hubble/releases/2026/07/STScI-01KY7FCQSFZQV2HS57RRQSQF9N.jpg?w=1280&#038;h=720&#038;fit=crop&#038;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1280w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/dynamicimage/assets/science/missions/hubble/releases/2026/07/STScI-01KY7FCQSFZQV2HS57RRQSQF9N.jpg?w=300&#038;h=169&#038;fit=crop&#038;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 300w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/dynamicimage/assets/science/missions/hubble/releases/2026/07/STScI-01KY7FCQSFZQV2HS57RRQSQF9N.jpg?w=768&#038;h=432&#038;fit=crop&#038;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 768w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/dynamicimage/assets/science/missions/hubble/releases/2026/07/STScI-01KY7FCQSFZQV2HS57RRQSQF9N.jpg?w=1024&#038;h=576&#038;fit=crop&#038;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1024w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/dynamicimage/assets/science/missions/hubble/releases/2026/07/STScI-01KY7FCQSFZQV2HS57RRQSQF9N.jpg?w=400&#038;h=225&#038;fit=crop&#038;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 400w, https://assets.science.nasa.gov/dynamicimage/assets/science/missions/hubble/releases/2026/07/STScI-01KY7FCQSFZQV2HS57RRQSQF9N.jpg?w=600&#038;h=338&#038;fit=crop&#038;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 600w, https://assets.s