+      "description": "NASAâ€™s Neil Gehrels Swift Observatory captured an â€œorphanâ€ black hole lighting up as it devoured a star on the outskirts of a faraway galaxy. These phenomena are rare to begin with, and none had ever before been seen so far outside of a galaxyâ€™s core. â€œWe were looking for these star-shredding events as a way [â€¦]",
+      "published_at": "Mon, 27 Jul 2026 16:06:37 +0000",
