olitical elections, public health emergencies, armed conflicts, natural disasters, and issues affecting people's livelihoods.\",\n  \"Governments and platforms are urged to prepare in advance rather than waiting for false information to go viral before trying to contain it.\"\n], \"uncertain_facts\": [\n  \"Specific examples of AI-generated content that led to real-world consequences are not clearly documented.\",\n  \"Detailed statistics on the number of AI-generated fake videos during recent natural disasters are not available.\",\n  \"The long-term impact of government crackdowns on AI misinformation is not yet known.\",\n  \"Public perception surveys on trust in official sources during disasters are not provided.\"\n], \"conflicting_claims\": [\n  \"Some experts argue that AI-generated misinformation is a growing threat that requires stronger legal and technological measures.\",\n  \"Others believe that the issue stems more from human behavior and the misuse of AI rather than the technology itself.\",\n  \"There is debate over whether platforms should be held legally accountable for AI-generated misinformation or if the responsibility lies solely with the creators.\"\n], \"timeline\": [\n  \"2026-07-28: BBC article published on AI-generated fake content in China during natural disasters.\",\n  \"2026-07-23: China's Cyberspace Administration announces crackdown on fake content related to floods and disasters.\",\n  \"2026-07-08: Typhoon Maysak floods burst dam wall in China.\",\n  \"2026-07-07: Rare tornadoes in central Chinese cities.\",\n  \"2026-07-01: Earlier reports on AI-generated content during natural disasters in China.\"\n], \"claim_to_source\": [\n  {\n    \"claim\": \"China is facing a growing challenge with AI-generated fake content during natural disasters.\",\n    \"source_ids\": [\"bbc_article\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"claim\": \"Fake AI videos have been circulating on social media platforms, including images of dead bodies in floodwaters.\",\n    \"so